WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:01.584
Hey,

00:02.085 --> 00:02.961
where's that other punk?

00:03.044 --> 00:03.837
Huh?

00:03.920 --> 00:05.964
Is that little asshole bringing the cops?

00:08.425 --> 00:10.510
You dumb little high school bitch,
I got ya.

00:12.554 --> 00:13.179
Hey,

00:13.680 --> 00:14.889
- load faster.
- That's heavy.

00:14.973 --> 00:15.849
You got the paperwork?

00:15.932 --> 00:16.599
Yeah,

00:17.100 --> 00:18.977
- I brought everything.
- Then hurry up.

00:32.782 --> 00:34.075
Hey, hey, hey. Hurry it up.

00:34.576 --> 00:35.702
Oh shit.

00:35.785 --> 00:36.578
Hurry up!

00:37.162 --> 00:38.079
Shit, shit.

00:38.621 --> 00:39.164
- Hey, hurry!
- Hurry up!

00:39.247 --> 00:40.123
Come on!

00:43.126 --> 00:44.586
Come on, come on, come
on, come on, come on.

00:44.669 --> 00:45.712
Let's get outta here!

01:00.852 --> 01:02.103
KIM GIL-SU

01:06.900 --> 01:10.278
- Hey hyung, sorry my battery was dead.
- Don't fucking bullshit me.

01:10.820 --> 01:12.197
Tell me where you are?!

01:14.574 --> 01:15.283
Hey,

01:15.784 --> 01:17.827
it's over,
so you better come to Mangwoo-dong

01:17.911 --> 01:19.954
with Yeong-i, that fucking bitch.

01:24.876 --> 01:26.211
Seong-chan is here.

01:28.421 --> 01:29.756
You better fucking hurry

01:30.340 --> 01:32.842
or else I'm gonna sell him somewhere.
Got it?

01:35.220 --> 01:35.929
Yes.

01:41.976 --> 01:42.602
Seong-chan?

01:43.103 --> 01:44.354
What'd he say?

01:50.527 --> 01:51.277
I need to get going.

01:51.778 --> 01:52.612
You stay here.

01:54.239 --> 01:55.782
Rent out a room for a few days.

01:56.616 --> 01:57.909
Where are you going?

02:00.495 --> 02:01.579
Don't follow me.

02:03.540 --> 02:04.374
Oppa!

02:11.172 --> 02:12.048
ASSHOLE

02:19.764 --> 02:20.640
What happened?

02:20.723 --> 02:21.474
What's going on?

02:21.975 --> 02:23.351
I'm at the address you gave me,

02:23.852 --> 02:25.061
but no one's here.

02:29.399 --> 02:30.150
Those shitheads

02:31.234 --> 02:32.485
took Su-ho, didn't they?

02:33.778 --> 02:36.197
Send me a friend request on WithMap,
like right now.

02:36.698 --> 02:37.532
What?

02:38.533 --> 02:39.576
You don't have it?

02:41.536 --> 02:43.371
WithMap's on the app store. Download it.

02:44.372 --> 02:46.875
It's a location-sharing app,
so get it and follow me.

02:50.128 --> 02:51.004
Where are you going?

02:51.504 --> 02:52.672
I don't know yet.

02:54.674 --> 02:56.217
Make sure you bring the police.

02:57.343 --> 02:58.636
Or we're really gonna die.

03:00.722 --> 03:01.556
Okay.

03:07.562 --> 03:08.313
Oppa!

03:10.773 --> 03:12.192
I'm not letting you go alone.

03:14.235 --> 03:15.236
I'm coming with you.

03:28.166 --> 03:29.292
I'll be fine. Okay?

03:30.126 --> 03:30.752
Bye.

03:31.252 --> 03:32.253
Why did you send Su-ho there alone?

03:32.337 --> 03:35.089
What are you going to do if
something happens to him?

03:42.222 --> 03:44.224
YEONG-I:
COME TO MANGU-DONG FIRST

03:44.307 --> 03:46.017
YOUR FRIENDS ARE THERE

04:10.416 --> 04:12.627
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:26.117 --> 05:27.076
You're so annoying.

05:27.577 --> 05:29.203
How long are you gonna follow me?

05:29.287 --> 05:30.538
Hey, knock it off.

05:53.811 --> 05:54.729
Su-ho-ya.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.321
You alright?

06:05.865 --> 06:06.991
Hey how'd you uh-

06:08.034 --> 06:09.410
how did you end up here?

06:09.494 --> 06:11.412
I thought that you might be in trouble.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.206
I was kinda worried.

06:13.873 --> 06:16.084
I went to that guy's house
to give him the money,

06:16.167 --> 06:17.919
but then they took me here.

06:18.711 --> 06:19.545
Oh.

06:21.714 --> 06:23.841
Hey, that warms me up like dogani tang.

06:23.925 --> 06:25.426
- Wow.
- Hey, hey.

06:25.510 --> 06:27.762
- I could go for a drink.
- Hey assholes, shut your

06:27.845 --> 06:29.013
fucking mouths, alright?

06:29.097 --> 06:29.764
Hey,

06:30.348 --> 06:32.809
let us talk over here.
I'm sad enough as it is,

06:32.892 --> 06:34.268
being tied up like this.

06:34.936 --> 06:36.729
Also, smoking's
really bad for your health.

06:36.813 --> 06:37.688
You keep talking.

06:37.772 --> 06:38.439
Aw, shit.

06:44.987 --> 06:45.655
Yeong-a.

06:46.948 --> 06:47.782
Yeah?

06:50.576 --> 06:51.702
Remember to stay quiet.

06:53.037 --> 06:53.955
Don't act up.

06:56.916 --> 06:58.418
You always say the same thing.

06:59.377 --> 07:00.211
I'm sorry.

07:01.254 --> 07:03.798
It's my fault we got involved
with Gil-su to begin with.

07:04.590 --> 07:07.260
This wouldn't have happened
if you hadn't followed me.

07:09.971 --> 07:10.805
Hey.

07:13.099 --> 07:14.684
Do you like me?

07:18.521 --> 07:19.439
Don't be an idiot.

07:48.009 --> 07:48.718
Hello?

07:49.927 --> 07:51.888
I just made a report about Mangwoo-dong.

07:52.430 --> 07:53.431
Are you on your way?

08:05.985 --> 08:06.903
Come here.

08:17.163 --> 08:18.080
Hey, Seok-dae-ya.

08:18.831 --> 08:19.665
Did I-

08:20.416 --> 08:22.126
do something to hurt your feelings?

08:23.920 --> 08:25.796
I fed you, and housed you.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.756
I mean,

08:27.340 --> 08:29.133
I even paid you a lot of money.

08:30.259 --> 08:30.968
Why?

08:31.469 --> 08:34.305
Did your heart get soft because
you got a family of your own?

08:34.388 --> 08:35.515
I'll take the beating, hyung.

08:36.891 --> 08:37.975
Nn, nn, nn.

08:39.310 --> 08:40.645
I was just curious.

08:45.107 --> 08:46.108
Get it over with.

08:51.364 --> 08:52.240
Alright.

08:53.658 --> 08:55.409
Take the beating then, asshole.

09:05.086 --> 09:07.421
You piece of shit. Huh? Fuck.

09:07.922 --> 09:09.215
You shithead mother fucker!

09:11.592 --> 09:12.426
Oppa!

09:16.305 --> 09:18.391
- Oppa, please don't.
- You bitch! So you --

09:18.474 --> 09:19.183
You did it.

09:19.684 --> 09:21.018
You're responsible for this.

09:23.145 --> 09:23.938
Hey,

09:24.021 --> 09:25.356
take this bitch, get rid of her.

09:27.900 --> 09:28.734
Get off!

09:29.235 --> 09:31.070
Let go, you fucking assholes!

09:31.571 --> 09:33.072
Let go! Let go of me!

09:33.155 --> 09:35.283
Get your grubby-ass hands off me!

09:36.742 --> 09:37.994
Hey, Seong-chan-a.

09:40.663 --> 09:42.039
Hey, Seong-chan-a.

09:47.795 --> 09:49.547
You're turning fourteen this year, right?

09:50.923 --> 09:51.757
Yes.

09:57.555 --> 09:59.557
So you stabbed those guys then, alright?

10:07.148 --> 10:08.274
Don't be such a coward.

10:09.650 --> 10:11.485
You're a minor.
You won't get thrown in jail.

10:11.986 --> 10:12.737
Agh,

10:13.237 --> 10:14.363
I'm anxious.

10:21.037 --> 10:23.372
JUNGNANG-GU
YEONG-I

10:28.794 --> 10:31.714
Which one of you should I stab?

10:31.797 --> 10:33.132
Eenie, meenie,

10:33.633 --> 10:34.508
mi-

10:35.092 --> 10:35.676
nie,

10:36.177 --> 10:37.011
moe.

10:40.514 --> 10:41.849
Ding, dong, ding,

10:43.225 --> 10:44.060
dong.

10:47.855 --> 10:48.564
Hey, man.

10:49.565 --> 10:51.192
Let's work something out.

10:52.151 --> 10:53.361
Shut your mouth.

10:53.903 --> 10:55.905
Yeah? This might sting a little.

10:56.489 --> 10:57.323
Okay?

11:02.536 --> 11:03.371
God --

11:04.121 --> 11:07.208
- Agh.
- Enough is enough, goddamn piece of shit.

11:07.750 --> 11:08.542
Woah, woah.

11:12.046 --> 11:12.880
Oppa!

11:14.340 --> 11:16.717
Everybody stay still, or I will kill you.

11:22.598 --> 11:24.350
Let's go, one on one, you and me.

11:25.101 --> 11:27.478
- If I win, you leave us alone.
- Fucking shit.

11:27.561 --> 11:29.689
What, you take me for a punk-ass bitch?

11:32.900 --> 11:34.860
You asshole. Fuck you.

11:37.697 --> 11:38.489
Fucking bitch.

11:40.700 --> 11:43.953
Hey! Let go of me you fucking shithead!

11:44.954 --> 11:46.247
Come here. Fuck.

11:46.747 --> 11:48.416
God damn, asshole!

11:48.916 --> 11:50.042
- I gave you food
- Fucker!

11:50.126 --> 11:51.043
And a place to stay

11:51.127 --> 11:51.877
right?!

11:56.757 --> 11:57.591
Agh!

12:00.386 --> 12:01.387
Damn it.

12:02.263 --> 12:04.724
Stop before you really get
your ass beat to hell.

12:06.308 --> 12:07.226
God damn.

12:21.615 --> 12:23.451
Hey, Seok-dae-ya.

12:23.534 --> 12:24.744
Are you at least having fun?

12:25.244 --> 12:26.328
Huh?

12:26.954 --> 12:28.789
You know that you'll never beat me.

12:29.540 --> 12:30.416
Because

12:30.499 --> 12:33.794
your big dumbass heart gets in the way,
you piece of shit-

12:37.339 --> 12:38.299
Ow, fuck.

12:39.425 --> 12:41.135
- Stupid bitch.
- You hit him from behind?

12:41.218 --> 12:43.471
Enough is enough, you goddamn fuckers!

12:43.554 --> 12:46.766
- You fucking bitch, I'll--
- You want to fuck around and find out?

12:49.727 --> 12:50.686
Get Seok-dae oppa.

12:52.188 --> 12:53.439
Hey, don't move.

12:53.522 --> 12:56.233
- Fucking bitch.
- Hey, stay where you are, asshole!

12:58.944 --> 13:00.029
- Not again.
- Agh, one sec.

13:00.112 --> 13:01.113
Hold on.

13:01.822 --> 13:02.448
Agh.

13:03.115 --> 13:04.950
I'm bleeding. Just a minute.

13:05.451 --> 13:07.077
Goddamn bitch.

13:07.661 --> 13:09.371
You fucking bitch.

13:10.372 --> 13:11.916
Die, you little shit.

13:14.710 --> 13:17.755
Ever since Seok-dae fucking met you-

13:18.339 --> 13:19.173
Die.

13:24.094 --> 13:25.429
Shit, damn it.

13:26.305 --> 13:27.598
- Oh no.
- Hyung!

13:27.681 --> 13:28.516
Hyung!

13:44.782 --> 13:45.616
Fuck,

13:46.534 --> 13:48.202
I thought you were a dumbass kid.

13:48.869 --> 13:50.329
But you're freakin' brave,

13:50.955 --> 13:51.872
aren't you?

13:52.873 --> 13:53.499
It's over.

13:53.999 --> 13:55.167
The police are here.

13:55.835 --> 13:57.878
They'll probably search
your car down there.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.421
God damn it.

13:59.505 --> 14:00.631
- Oh shit.
- Let's go.

14:05.177 --> 14:06.053
Are you okay?

14:09.306 --> 14:10.391
Si-eun-a.

14:10.474 --> 14:11.934
What's going on?

14:12.601 --> 14:13.644
I'm sorry I'm late.

14:15.938 --> 14:17.982
- We almost died, can you untie us?
- Yeah.

14:21.402 --> 14:22.820
Agh, ow my arms.

14:22.903 --> 14:23.988
Let's get out of here.

14:26.282 --> 14:27.116
Nice.

14:31.537 --> 14:33.664
I'm never coming back
to an amusement park.

14:37.167 --> 14:39.712
- Hey, why are they back?
- For fuck's sake.

14:42.047 --> 14:42.882
Hey.

14:44.008 --> 14:46.093
You think that you're so smart, don't ya.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.012
These little fucking kids

14:48.596 --> 14:50.055
trying to trick me?

14:50.639 --> 14:51.473
Fuck.

14:52.141 --> 14:53.767
I'm done playing your game.

14:54.435 --> 14:56.770
- Go get them!
- Aw man, you should've told us.

14:59.440 --> 15:00.733
Kick their ass!

15:14.163 --> 15:15.080
Here we go.

15:21.253 --> 15:22.254
Yeong-a.

15:22.880 --> 15:23.797
Let's go.

15:24.298 --> 15:25.257
We have to go.

15:33.140 --> 15:33.974
Huh?!

15:34.475 --> 15:34.934
The police.

15:35.434 --> 15:36.352
- What?
- What are you doing?

15:36.435 --> 15:38.062
- You gotta leave, now.
- Why?

15:38.145 --> 15:38.729
Kids!

15:39.229 --> 15:39.897
You little--

15:41.398 --> 15:41.899
Come here!

15:45.694 --> 15:49.114
- You psycho son of a bitch.
- You stupid fucking asshole.

15:51.075 --> 15:52.910
- Move aside.
- Fuck.

15:58.832 --> 16:00.209
Did you think I wouldn't stab you

16:00.709 --> 16:02.503
just because you were a kid?

16:02.586 --> 16:03.420
Huh?

16:04.213 --> 16:05.255
That's why

16:05.839 --> 16:09.635
you should've given me the money when
I asked for it, you little shit.

16:10.135 --> 16:10.719
Yeah?

16:11.220 --> 16:12.262
Huh?

16:15.557 --> 16:16.558
Don't move!

16:16.642 --> 16:17.768
Hands up!

16:19.853 --> 16:21.605
Number two-twenty, this is forty-three.

16:21.689 --> 16:23.774
All suspects in report two nine one
seven are involved in an assault case…

16:23.857 --> 16:25.985
- You fucking little prick.
- Next time, you're all dead.

16:26.068 --> 16:27.778
- Number two-twenty, this is forty-three.
- Stay where you are.

16:27.861 --> 16:29.697
All suspects in report- Don't move!

16:29.780 --> 16:31.573
I think there's some
kind of a misunderstanding-

16:31.657 --> 16:32.825
These are live bullets.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.869
Oh, we're cooperating, sir.

16:37.246 --> 16:39.123
- Right?
- Uh-huh.

16:39.206 --> 16:41.667
Wait,
didn't we play soccer together last month…

16:42.292 --> 16:42.793
Agh.

16:43.627 --> 16:44.753
Nobody move.

16:45.713 --> 16:46.255
Hey, hey, hey.

16:46.755 --> 16:47.381
I'm not.

16:47.464 --> 16:48.298
Stay still.

16:51.468 --> 16:52.594
Hey. Hey!

16:53.262 --> 16:54.179
Yeon Si-eun!

16:54.805 --> 16:55.806
Where are you going?

17:06.316 --> 17:07.151
Shit.

17:30.382 --> 17:31.383
You scared me.

17:32.134 --> 17:35.137
Oh, fuck this.
This is some fucking bullshit, man.

17:35.220 --> 17:35.846
I hate this.

17:36.346 --> 17:37.139
Hey,

17:37.639 --> 17:38.891
why're you fucking following me around?!

17:38.974 --> 17:39.808
Huh?

17:48.776 --> 17:50.569
Geez, this stupid little kid.

17:55.741 --> 17:57.534
You're fucking impossible,
you little prick.

18:01.163 --> 18:01.997
Fuck.

18:10.005 --> 18:11.340
Where should I stab you?

18:12.091 --> 18:12.925
Huh?

18:17.513 --> 18:18.347
Hey!

18:24.978 --> 18:25.813
Ah,

18:26.647 --> 18:27.523
guess I gotta

18:28.565 --> 18:29.608
kick your ass.

18:31.026 --> 18:33.445
Why've you both been coming
after me all day?!

18:33.529 --> 18:34.905
Shit man, I am so

18:34.988 --> 18:35.656
sick of this crap.

18:36.240 --> 18:36.949
Well?

18:37.449 --> 18:38.075
Come on.

18:40.953 --> 18:41.787
Shit.

18:44.081 --> 18:46.041
- You're pretty good, kid.
- Yeah, and you're slow.

18:46.125 --> 18:46.959
Hmm?

18:49.920 --> 18:50.963
Shit head!

18:51.046 --> 18:51.880
Hey!

18:55.008 --> 18:55.843
Hey!

19:06.311 --> 19:07.229
That's it?

19:22.744 --> 19:23.745
Oh, man.

19:40.053 --> 19:41.013
Eat shit!

19:52.941 --> 19:53.609
Hey,

19:54.109 --> 19:55.611
have you lost your mind or what?

19:57.654 --> 19:59.448
Why would you go by yourself

20:00.032 --> 20:00.866
Huh?

20:01.450 --> 20:02.367
You came.

20:04.536 --> 20:05.787
Wow, what a load of shit.

20:05.871 --> 20:06.747
You know,

20:06.830 --> 20:08.290
you really are a psycho.

20:09.124 --> 20:09.958
Yeah?

20:13.086 --> 20:14.630
I'm not the only one.

20:17.007 --> 20:18.675
You won't let me have the last word,

20:18.759 --> 20:19.426
will you?

20:20.052 --> 20:21.053
If I were you,

20:22.054 --> 20:23.222
I'd let me win.

20:24.431 --> 20:25.390
You psycho.

20:43.825 --> 20:45.035
- Come here.
- Damn it.

20:51.124 --> 20:54.002
What are you doing? Stop messing around!

20:55.087 --> 20:55.754
Go.

20:56.255 --> 20:57.881
- You must go.
- Stop this bullshit and come with us!

20:57.965 --> 20:59.716
Fucking listen to me, Yeong-a!

21:02.219 --> 21:02.844
Go.

21:03.345 --> 21:04.721
It's not your fault.

21:05.514 --> 21:06.598
You're really…

21:07.266 --> 21:08.058
Let's go, nuna.

21:08.558 --> 21:09.518
Hey.

21:10.060 --> 21:12.604
- Come on!
- Hey! Fuck this, hey!

21:13.272 --> 21:14.648
You're so annoying!

21:14.731 --> 21:16.149
Hey, Jeon Seok-dae!

21:16.858 --> 21:18.652
- I can't believe you!
- Young man,

21:19.319 --> 21:20.320
put your hands up.

21:21.863 --> 21:22.823
I said, hands up.

21:27.369 --> 21:28.245
Let me fucking go!

21:30.580 --> 21:32.040
- I already told you everything, fuck!
- Let go! Let go!

21:32.124 --> 21:34.459
- Why won't you just let me go?!
- Shut up and cooperate.

21:34.543 --> 21:36.920
- Get your hands off me, I'm cooperating!
- How humiliating, shit.

21:37.004 --> 21:38.005
Come on!

21:38.088 --> 21:39.172
Additional officers are on their way.

21:39.256 --> 21:40.382
Stop resisting.

21:40.465 --> 21:41.133
I'm not!

21:46.722 --> 21:47.848
I'm coming for ya,

21:49.850 --> 21:50.976
when I'm out, kay?

21:51.768 --> 21:52.352
Yeah?

22:02.195 --> 22:04.281
- Damn it! -Fuck!
- What's going on?

22:04.364 --> 22:06.491
- Agghh.
- Let's not cross paths

22:06.575 --> 22:08.118
anymore, you fucking dick.

22:08.660 --> 22:09.494
Shit.

22:13.206 --> 22:14.583
Ahh, dogani-tang.

22:15.834 --> 22:17.461
Ahh, I'm so hungry, seriously.

22:17.961 --> 22:19.504
Dogani-tang. Ah.

22:21.214 --> 22:23.008
Do you have a tapeworm or something?

22:23.091 --> 22:27.596
The moment I thought about dogani-tang,
I just couldn't get it out of my mind.

22:27.679 --> 22:29.890
- With kkakdugi, aw man.
- Here you guys are.

22:32.017 --> 22:32.684
What?

22:33.352 --> 22:35.062
What a relief, you're still alive.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.314
I thought this guy was dead.

22:37.814 --> 22:40.317
Well, after you two left,
I went looking for Si-eun's

22:40.400 --> 22:41.360
phone and stuff,

22:41.443 --> 22:43.779
but I couldn't see anything,
so I took a while.

22:45.822 --> 22:46.656
Here.

22:50.827 --> 22:52.496
The screen's a little broken.

22:53.955 --> 22:54.831
Thanks.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.459
Uh, Yeon Si-eun-gun?

22:59.252 --> 23:02.089
We need you to come to the
station to make a statement.

23:03.548 --> 23:04.591
Your friend too.

23:12.182 --> 23:13.433
- Uncuff me!
- You need to calm the fuck

23:13.517 --> 23:15.477
- down, just have a seat first.
- You have no right to arrest me!

23:15.560 --> 23:18.188
- I'm not fucking saying anything!
- Sit down, alright?

23:39.000 --> 23:39.960
I'm sorry.

23:42.379 --> 23:43.213
What?

23:44.005 --> 23:45.090
You were right.

23:46.133 --> 23:47.384
Because of me, Su-ho…

23:49.428 --> 23:50.262
Sorry.

23:52.431 --> 23:53.014
Don't

23:53.515 --> 23:54.266
say that.

23:54.766 --> 23:55.725
You were

23:55.809 --> 23:58.854
late because I took the taxi alone.

23:59.521 --> 24:00.439
I'm sorry too.

24:21.418 --> 24:23.253
The superintendent and I made a deal.

24:23.879 --> 24:25.881
It will be… our little secret.

24:27.132 --> 24:29.509
You both are completely
irrelevant to this case.

24:31.970 --> 24:32.804
What?

24:36.057 --> 24:37.517
Si-eun-gun, your family doesn't need

24:37.601 --> 24:38.810
to be made aware of this.

24:43.815 --> 24:44.941
You should go home.

25:05.629 --> 25:06.421
Excuse me.

25:09.132 --> 25:12.511
The only person who did anything wrong
was the man named Kim Gil-su.

25:13.845 --> 25:15.680
He blackmailed and exploited everybody.

25:18.016 --> 25:19.100
I'd appreciate it

25:19.184 --> 25:20.602
if you showed them mercy.

25:27.025 --> 25:27.609
Okay.

25:28.109 --> 25:28.777
Go on home.

25:36.910 --> 25:37.744
Did you keep it

25:38.245 --> 25:39.663
a secret from my father?

25:40.622 --> 25:41.456
No.

25:43.041 --> 25:44.042
We should head out too.

25:48.338 --> 25:49.214
I mean,

25:50.757 --> 25:53.134
I asked you to keep it a secret from him.

25:55.554 --> 25:56.471
Let's go.

26:05.313 --> 26:06.147
Is that so?

26:08.525 --> 26:09.150
I'm telling you.

26:09.651 --> 26:10.485
I heard you.

26:10.986 --> 26:13.530
- You have to understand.
- That's why I'm listening.

26:14.114 --> 26:15.156
Hey, psycho.

26:20.078 --> 26:21.746
Let's grab a bite to eat, sometime.

26:24.958 --> 26:26.543
Why do you all love food so much?

26:58.074 --> 26:58.992
What's up?

27:02.370 --> 27:03.538
How's Seok-dae oppa?

27:04.539 --> 27:06.041
He's being questioned, inside.

27:09.753 --> 27:10.920
He'll be fine.

27:14.883 --> 27:15.884
What about the others?

27:19.262 --> 27:20.847
I can't reach anyone.

27:21.890 --> 27:23.433
The youngest one went home.

27:29.105 --> 27:29.814
And you?

27:45.246 --> 27:46.081
Hey.

27:46.748 --> 27:47.666
What the hell?

27:51.169 --> 27:52.003
Huh?

27:53.922 --> 27:57.008
The assemblyman wanted you to give
that man an eye for an eye.

27:57.550 --> 27:58.385
Sorry?

27:59.135 --> 28:00.970
This is the police station.

28:01.971 --> 28:04.474
- You're beating someone here?
- Go ahead.

28:05.809 --> 28:07.227
I-I'm alright.

28:08.561 --> 28:10.897
Bullshit fucking idiots. Fuck this.

28:14.651 --> 28:15.276
Hey.

28:18.029 --> 28:19.614
Stay still. Don't move a muscle.

28:20.949 --> 28:21.991
Now, watch what I do.

28:23.118 --> 28:24.202
One, two.

28:24.953 --> 28:25.704
Okay? One, two.

28:29.040 --> 28:30.375
That hurts.

28:34.921 --> 28:37.799
Use your imagination,
like you're hitting a punching bag.

28:38.383 --> 28:39.634
Okay. Hit me.

28:39.718 --> 28:41.636
Dumb fuck. Hey, Maltese.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.471
Come at me like your friends did.

28:44.055 --> 28:44.764
Ahh.

28:44.848 --> 28:45.765
Wait, never mind.

28:46.599 --> 28:49.144
You're just their minion.
You're not their friend.

28:49.227 --> 28:52.230
You're some kind of little fucking
coward compared to those guys-

28:52.313 --> 28:54.023
All right, you fucking asshole.

28:54.524 --> 28:55.567
Hey,

28:55.650 --> 28:56.609
hit me.

28:57.402 --> 28:58.236
Do it!

28:58.903 --> 28:59.487
Come hit me!

28:59.988 --> 29:00.822
Do it!

29:30.310 --> 29:31.144
Hmm?

29:35.774 --> 29:36.608
Well…

29:37.776 --> 29:39.027
She wanted to apologize.

29:40.195 --> 29:41.029
Hello.

29:44.657 --> 29:45.492
Wait.

29:46.326 --> 29:48.912
You don't seem like someone
who's here to apologize.

29:50.038 --> 29:50.830
My bad.

29:54.542 --> 29:55.460
You're nuts.

29:56.753 --> 29:57.879
How did it go with you?

29:59.506 --> 30:01.299
I don't know if it's a good thing,

30:01.382 --> 30:03.426
but Beom-seok's family's covering it up.

30:04.010 --> 30:05.512
They took our names out of the case.

30:06.012 --> 30:07.222
And Kim Gil-su's detained.

30:08.765 --> 30:09.349
Is

30:09.849 --> 30:10.725
Beom-seok's dad

30:10.809 --> 30:12.268
a chairman of some place?

30:12.769 --> 30:14.354
His family's secretary or whoever,

30:14.437 --> 30:16.981
came by and said they'd pay
my whole hospital bill.

30:17.065 --> 30:19.984
I declined,
but should I have just accepted it?

30:21.528 --> 30:22.570
He's an assemblyman.

30:22.654 --> 30:23.738
Oh Jin-won.

30:26.032 --> 30:26.866
Wow.

30:32.914 --> 30:34.207
How long will you be in here?

30:35.458 --> 30:36.876
I'll be discharged tomorrow.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.127
It's a light fracture.

30:39.587 --> 30:41.297
Then like, can I sleep here tonight?

30:41.798 --> 30:42.882
Yeah, do what you want.

30:42.966 --> 30:44.217
All right!

30:46.803 --> 30:48.763
Hey, you were freaking cool back there.

30:49.597 --> 30:52.058
- Yeah, I'm pretty cool.
- Yeah, I got goosebumps.

30:52.141 --> 30:54.102
"You wanna fuck around and find out?!"

30:55.478 --> 30:58.106
"Enough's enough, you goddamn fuckers!"

30:59.190 --> 31:01.526
Why are you copying me,
idiot? Did you fall in love?

31:02.235 --> 31:03.194
Enough's enough.

31:04.112 --> 31:06.155
Too bad, so sad. I'm Si-eun's.

31:10.368 --> 31:11.411
Are you two dating?

31:11.494 --> 31:12.871
That's not happening.

31:14.122 --> 31:15.039
That's not happening?

31:15.540 --> 31:17.709
We know where each other's
at at all times.

31:18.501 --> 31:19.210
That's just

31:19.711 --> 31:21.170
that app's main function.

31:21.754 --> 31:23.923
You should just date each
other, you'd make a cute couple.

31:24.007 --> 31:24.924
Enough's enough.

31:27.385 --> 31:28.678
You little shit.

32:05.089 --> 32:05.673
Huh?

32:06.174 --> 32:06.966
What?

32:12.347 --> 32:13.389
- What's this?
- What's this?

32:13.890 --> 32:15.183
You were craving it.

32:21.981 --> 32:24.025
Ugh, I'll gain weight eating this late.

32:24.609 --> 32:25.318
Huh?

32:25.818 --> 32:27.654
Wow, look how late it is.

32:28.655 --> 32:30.406
You are so inconsiderate.

32:30.907 --> 32:33.618
I guess,
I should eat some just to be nice.

32:33.701 --> 32:34.994
Wow it looks amazing.

32:35.787 --> 32:37.038
What is this feeling?

32:37.956 --> 32:39.290
I just got the chills.

32:40.458 --> 32:41.334
What's with you?

32:43.294 --> 32:44.963
- What do you mean?
- I mean,

32:45.046 --> 32:46.005
you.

32:47.215 --> 32:47.882
You're being

32:48.383 --> 32:49.467
way too sweet.

32:49.550 --> 32:50.385
Huh?

32:51.010 --> 32:51.886
Your eyes,

32:51.970 --> 32:53.596
the way you act, talk,

32:54.305 --> 32:55.098
and your face.

32:56.933 --> 32:58.267
It's making me cringe.

33:23.042 --> 33:23.876
Eat your food.

33:43.438 --> 33:45.314
Si-eun you need to eat something too.

33:49.819 --> 33:51.404
Are you a mindreader?

33:59.912 --> 34:01.956
Well, before I'm an assemblyman,

34:02.457 --> 34:07.378
I'm also a citizen and a father,
and am naturally, extremely interested

34:07.879 --> 34:09.714
in the youth policies, obviously.

34:31.819 --> 34:32.653
What?

34:46.667 --> 34:47.502
Why did I

34:48.628 --> 34:49.879
ever bring you here?

34:51.923 --> 34:52.840
You are…

34:55.760 --> 34:58.137
just the wrong kind of breed.

34:59.972 --> 35:00.890
You know that?

37:44.053 --> 37:45.805
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

37:45.888 --> 37:47.932
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
